The kernel compartmentalization model isolates parts of the kernel and kernel
modules according to their link-time policies. The compartmentalized kernel
included in this package is equivalent to GENERIC-MORELLO-PURECAP with the
addition of the kernel compartmentalization mechanism.

This experimental kernel is currently developed in the separate kernel-c18n
branch of CheriBSD [1] with its own snapshots [2].

[1] https://github.com/CTSRD-CHERI/cheribsd/tree/kernel-c18n
[2] https://download.cheribsd.org/snapshots/kernel-c18n/arm64/aarch64c/
